    900  fb2e							; ==============================================================================
    901  fb2e							; PhVcApplyOR / PhVcApplyAND DELETED (2026-10-19) — same retired vcrunch
    902  fb2e							; tramp path. PhHcrEntry now stores the prefix mask directly (fixed 10).
    903  fb2e							; ==============================================================================
    904  fb2e							; ==============================================================================
    905  fb2e							; HcrClock — hcrunch animation clock (fixed full=10 since 2026-10-19).
    906  fb2e							;   In:  X = full extent (cells, ≥1); reads EnemyRamP (StartFrame-pinned)
    907  fb2e							;   Out: A = covered (1..full) — never 0 (always-solid stub)
    908  fb2e							;   Clobbers A (X/Y preserved — unlike CrunchClock). No latch: the kill
    909  fb2e							;   repeats on contact (DropArm respawns at the room top, so no loop).
    910  fb2e							; s = EnemyRamP>>4 (0..15, one 256f period = 16 buckets of 16f):
    911  fb2e							;   s 0-3   dwell at home  (eff 0)	  -> n=1, 64f stub
    912  fb2e							;   s 4-12  grow to center  (eff s-3)	  -> n 2..full (1..9 cells of
    913  fb2e							;	    8px — full=w>>1; w=20 record = center of the screen)
    914  fb2e							;   s 13-15 fast retract    (eff 3*(15-s) = 6,3,0) — wipe home in 3
    915  fb2e							;	    steps (the old instant far-end turn, stretched to center)
    916  fb2e							; covered = 1 + min(eff, full-1). CrunchClock (sc>>2 triangle, ~4f/step)
    917  fb2e							; stays for its VCR mirrors + verify_build token gate — only the two
    918  fb2e							; hcrunch call sites moved here (16f/step, grow-to-center ruling
    919  fb2e							; 2026-10-16). Both callers pass full=10 (PhHcrEntry stages it, HOV
    920  fb2e							; tests it); the latch freeze was removed with the 2026-10-19 contract.
    921  fb2e							; ==============================================================================
    922  fb2e				   HcrClock
    923  fb2e		       e0 01		      cpx	#1
    924  fb30		       d0 03		      bne	.hcN
    925  fb32		       a9 01		      lda	#1	; full=1: n always 1
    926  fb34		       60		      rts
    927  fb35				   .hcN
    928  fb35		       a5 c2		      lda	EnemyRamP
    929  fb37		       4a		      lsr
    930  fb38		       4a		      lsr
    931  fb39		       4a		      lsr
    932  fb3a		       4a		      lsr		; s = P>>4
    933  fb3b		       c9 04		      cmp	#4
    934  fb3d		       b0 04		      bcs	.hcNd
    935  fb3f		       a9 00		      lda	#0	; s0-3 dwell: eff 0
    936  fb41		       f0 11		      beq	.hcOut	; (always)
    937  fb43				   .hcNd
