   1273  ff59							; .HOVfeature dispatch. IN: A = record class, Y = record base,
   1274  ff59							; FetchPtr = record stream (all same-bank since A3). No field pre-read and
   1275  ff59							; no stack: fields are read at (FetchPtr),base+1..4 as needed. Returns to
   1276  ff59							; HOVnext / HOVlegHit (both pop the .HOVloop base) or HOVafterGate ($80,
